=== PSBT example (Version 2) ===

The following worked example shows the full signing flow for a Version 2 fidelity bond, from an unsigned [[bip-0174.mediawiki|PSBT]] through to a finalized transaction, including the fields a hardware wallet needs (<tt>witness_utxo</tt>, <tt>witness_script</tt>, <tt>PSBT_IN_BIP32_DERIVATION</tt>, <tt>PSBT_GLOBAL_XPUB</tt>, <tt>SIGHASH_ALL</tt>, a non-final <tt>nSequence</tt>, and the transaction <tt>nLocktime</tt> required by <tt>OP_CHECKLOCKTIMEVERIFY</tt>). It spends the first timelocked address (<tt>m/46'/0'/0'/0/0</tt>) from the Version 2 test vectors above. The funding outpoint is illustrative and not a real UTXO.

