The Version 3 output keys and PSBT-example sighashes were recomputed with implementations independent of the code that generated them. The tweak computation used also reproduces the <tt>scriptPubKey</tt> test vectors published with [[bip-0341.mediawiki|BIP341]]. The signatures were verified against the recomputed sighashes, and the spending script was evaluated to confirm that the mature spend succeeds and the pre-locktime spend fails at <tt>OP_CHECKLOCKTIMEVERIFY</tt>.

